From 641bb5a850f896f861f1d114c206d6a9cd1fd9dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CustomKIMI <customkimi@localhost>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:29:57 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 14/14] customkimi: show the muse subscription's usage in
 /usage and the web UI

Adds a "Muse" section to the existing /usage command (shown whenever a
muse provider is configured) and a usage pill in the kimi web UI shown
only when the active model is a muse model. Reads the forwarder's
GET /usage (weekly and rolling-window percentages, reset times, token
totals) over the muse provider's base URL. Kept separate from the
dollar-balance system; no other provider is affected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
