+/**
+ * CustomKIMI: the muse subscription's quotas, read from the forwarder whenever the muse
+ * provider is configured, whichever model is active. Undefined when it is not configured.
+ * `/usage` is dispatched fire-and-forget, so this never throws: `fetchMuseUsage` resolves
